WEBVTT

01:49.380 --> 01:50.630
<b>Owning a cat</b>

01:49.880 --> 01:50.630
<b>Caring for a kitty</b>

01:50.880 --> 01:52.130
<b>Cat at home all day</b>

01:51.380 --> 01:52.130
<b>Living with a cat</b>

01:52.380 --> 01:53.630
<b>Your first pet</b>

01:52.880 --> 01:53.630
<b>How cats live</b>

01:58.150 --> 02:04.310
<i>ID Number C-018 was developed 
as an anti-Earthling weapon.</i>

02:04.650 --> 02:09.310
<i>But I'm a useless reject.</i>

02:09.310 --> 02:10.890
<i>In fact...</i>

02:12.750 --> 02:15.070
It's practically a robot pet.

02:15.460 --> 02:18.540
<i>C-018 is not meant to be a pet.</i>

02:18.540 --> 02:21.530
<i>But rejects are no good for battle.</i>

02:21.920 --> 02:27.080
<i>Why did I ever come to exist?</i>

02:29.280 --> 02:32.340
Good morning, C-018.

02:34.950 --> 02:36.850
Glad to see you're full of energy.

02:37.190 --> 02:40.400
"C-018" is a mouthful to say.

02:40.400 --> 02:42.340
Can I give you a nickname?

02:45.180 --> 02:48.960
Oh, I guess the General 
should be the one to do that.

02:48.960 --> 02:51.910
I bet he'd get angry if I took the liberty.

02:51.910 --> 02:52.900
Hey.

02:52.900 --> 02:54.560
Yes, what is it?

02:54.560 --> 03:00.690
Once that man has taken custody, 
will C-018 have any responsibilities?

03:00.980 --> 03:02.360
Not especially.

03:02.840 --> 03:04.490
Nothing...?

03:04.490 --> 03:05.210
That's right.

03:06.360 --> 03:11.660
It's technically a probationary arrangement,
 so we don't want you causing any trouble.

03:11.660 --> 03:14.780
But we've installed a GPS, 
so you're free to roam.

03:18.370 --> 03:21.500
Dismantle C-018.

03:26.860 --> 03:28.170
I can't do that.

03:28.520 --> 03:31.050
You're a valuable specimen.

03:31.800 --> 03:33.030
Let go!

03:33.030 --> 03:36.860
Then shut me down and put me in storage!

03:36.860 --> 03:38.390
I can't do that either.

03:38.390 --> 03:39.300
Why not?!

03:39.300 --> 03:41.060
Because of the General.

03:41.730 --> 03:43.060
Sorry to bother you.

03:43.950 --> 03:46.560
Good morning, General. What's up?

03:46.560 --> 03:49.290
I came to see this one.

03:51.540 --> 03:53.430
Pick one.

03:54.160 --> 03:58.950
Pick one? Life or death? 
The means of execution?

03:58.950 --> 04:00.840
Huh? No.

04:00.840 --> 04:02.870
I meant a bed.

04:00.840 --> 04:04.840
<b>Cushion Cat Bed</b>

04:00.840 --> 04:04.840
<b>Domed-Shaped Cat House</b>

04:02.870 --> 04:07.710
I asked Trigger his opinion, 
and he angrily told me to ask C-018.

04:07.710 --> 04:09.310
Good thinking.

04:10.090 --> 04:11.550
Have you decided?

04:11.550 --> 04:13.540
If you don't choose one...

04:14.600 --> 04:16.610
<b>Panda Cat Bed</b>

04:14.600 --> 04:16.610
<b>Cat Food</b>

04:14.940 --> 04:16.590
it'll be this.

04:20.390 --> 04:23.620
A-Anything's fine.

04:23.620 --> 04:27.270
Okay, this one it is.

04:27.270 --> 04:30.990
Say, I'll be joining you on the next mission.

04:30.990 --> 04:32.090
All right.

04:32.090 --> 04:33.500
I'll be on my way.

04:37.920 --> 04:39.260
Do you see now?

04:40.540 --> 04:43.450
He won't ask much of you,

04:43.450 --> 04:47.800
but the General is very much looking 
forward to taking you home.

04:47.800 --> 04:52.050
So, though you may be reluctant, 
would you mind going with him?

04:52.560 --> 04:57.490
If you stay with him awhile
 and decide it's just not going to work,

04:57.490 --> 05:00.880
I promise to deactivate you 
and store you here at HQ.

05:07.940 --> 05:14.280
C-018 is here reluctantly. 
And using this thing reluctantly.

05:14.280 --> 05:15.610
Is that so?

05:15.610 --> 05:17.580
Reluctantly, you hear?!

05:17.960 --> 05:19.870
How comfortable is it?

05:24.220 --> 05:25.620
It's not bad.

05:25.970 --> 05:31.970
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

05:25.970 --> 05:31.970
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

06:04.940 --> 06:08.270
In the end, it never did bloom this year.

06:08.940 --> 06:11.410
I'm sure she was tired.

06:12.130 --> 06:15.200
Maybe she'll feel better next year!

06:15.200 --> 06:19.300
She may not have realized you're here.

06:19.300 --> 06:21.220
Yeah, I bet you're right!

06:21.220 --> 06:22.020
However...

06:23.170 --> 06:26.840
I suspect you were still holding 
out hope it would blossom.

06:28.780 --> 06:30.030
Shaddup!

06:30.030 --> 06:33.270
You said you'd wait as long as it takes, brat.

06:33.270 --> 06:35.720
Shaddup!

06:35.720 --> 06:39.170
I figured it was going to bloom.

06:40.450 --> 06:41.800
Really?

06:47.330 --> 06:50.410
Next year, I'll make enough for two.

07:03.100 --> 07:04.730
Edible triangles!

07:12.400 --> 07:13.630
You...

07:14.290 --> 07:16.280
You like these, don't you?

07:16.280 --> 07:19.090
Do you... want one?

07:31.850 --> 07:34.970
H-Humans are strange, aren't they?

07:35.260 --> 07:37.570
They make their food into triangles.

07:37.570 --> 07:43.990
That old guy... apparently isn't human,
 but he's a weird one, too.

07:44.310 --> 07:48.960
He made these triangles for us,
 and also that string telephone.

07:48.960 --> 07:52.150
I wonder where that ended up...

07:54.870 --> 07:59.620
There's so much more I wish I'd told you.

07:59.620 --> 08:03.630
I wish I could've talked to you
instead of watching from afar.

08:06.120 --> 08:08.510
Maybe we could have managed something.

08:09.850 --> 08:10.840
But...

08:14.850 --> 08:18.720
Now my voice will reach you, 
even without a string telephone.

08:19.380 --> 08:21.010
I want to talk to you.

08:23.580 --> 08:25.830
I'll be right here!

08:55.580 --> 08:58.630
<i>A single bud swelled.</i>

08:59.260 --> 09:02.150
<i>The next day, there was another.</i>

09:02.580 --> 09:05.340
<i>One after the other...</i>

09:05.340 --> 09:07.330
<i>I counted so many of them.</i>

09:08.210 --> 09:09.990
<i>I'm sure it'll bloom this year.</i>

09:11.050 --> 09:13.060
<i>I'll get to see her soon!</i>

09:14.260 --> 09:17.210
<i>And that's when I'll tell her...</i>

09:18.140 --> 09:20.470
I've always loved her!

09:21.610 --> 09:23.940
<i>He still hasn't told her?</i>

09:24.810 --> 09:27.830
And I'll be sure to tell her
 what I love about her!

09:27.830 --> 09:31.820
I think her flower petals 
are a pretty color.

09:31.820 --> 09:35.950
<i>What were they talking about on the 
string telephone all that time?</i>

09:36.700 --> 09:39.150
There's lots of other stuff, too.

09:39.150 --> 09:41.770
<i>He looks pretty darn happy.</i>

09:41.770 --> 09:45.640
You should take the time 
to practice telling her how you feel.

09:45.640 --> 09:47.950
Huh? What's this?

09:47.950 --> 09:49.300
Lunch for two.

10:00.070 --> 10:02.670
<i>It's enough for me and her...</i>

10:18.810 --> 10:22.510
<i>You should take the time 
to practice telling her how you feel.</i>

10:23.180 --> 10:24.330
Practice?

10:25.500 --> 10:26.330
I...

10:29.370 --> 10:30.530
I love you.

10:34.350 --> 10:37.500
S-Saying it all serious is embarrassing!

10:39.010 --> 10:42.740
But... I don't want any regrets.

10:42.740 --> 10:44.510
I'll do it right this time.

10:45.200 --> 10:47.550
I-I love you.

10:49.430 --> 10:51.850
I love you...

10:55.060 --> 10:56.230
I love you!

11:05.530 --> 11:06.550
Um...

11:07.500 --> 11:08.770
I mean...

11:23.810 --> 11:25.070
Listen!

11:29.930 --> 11:33.050
<i>Looks like the cherry tree manage to bloom.</i>

11:33.350 --> 11:37.550
<i>I dropped by the park 
just to check on things.</i>

11:37.550 --> 11:38.510
<i>But...</i>

11:39.380 --> 11:41.930
<b>stuck</b>

11:41.930 --> 11:44.900
<i>Why are they sitting on either side of me?</i>

11:45.720 --> 11:47.830
C'mere, old guy!

11:49.360 --> 11:50.370
Listen.

11:50.370 --> 11:54.060
Whisper, whisper, whisper...

11:54.060 --> 11:54.830
Huh?

11:55.250 --> 11:57.110
Tell her yourself.

11:57.110 --> 12:00.030
Just do it! Please!

12:07.560 --> 12:12.590
Uh, the boy next to me says 
your petals are a pretty color.

12:14.670 --> 12:16.510
<i>Will that do it?</i>

12:17.150 --> 12:18.400
Hey, hey.

12:22.370 --> 12:25.380
Whisper, whisper, whisper...

12:26.600 --> 12:30.720
Your leaves were a wonderful 
color too, she says.

12:33.150 --> 12:34.990
Whisper, whisper, whisper...

12:35.660 --> 12:39.330
He says your flowers are a cute shape.

12:40.630 --> 12:42.430
Whisper, whisper, whisper...

12:42.790 --> 12:46.990
She says your tree was a nice shape.

12:46.990 --> 12:51.490
Whisper, whisper, whisper...
Whisper, whisper, whisper...

12:51.760 --> 12:54.430
<i>Come on, can I leave now?</i>

12:57.390 --> 12:59.750
I-I...

13:04.240 --> 13:07.520
I wanted to say I love you!

13:27.990 --> 13:34.000
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

13:27.990 --> 13:34.000
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

13:34.000 --> 13:36.250
Unohara Shopping District

13:50.730 --> 13:51.970
<i>Uh-oh.</i>

13:51.970 --> 13:55.160
<i>That's Ranger Dawn Red!</i>

13:55.160 --> 13:56.690
<i>What's he doing here?</i>

13:56.690 --> 14:00.680
<i>He's been able to detect 
my presence in the past.</i>

14:01.160 --> 14:03.240
<i>I don't want him finding me.</i>

14:03.240 --> 14:06.670
<i>After all, today's my day off!</i>

14:09.420 --> 14:11.150
<i>I'll take the long way.</i>

14:19.010 --> 14:21.340
<i>Ranger Dawn Red!</i>

14:21.630 --> 14:23.270
<i>What's going on here?</i>

14:23.270 --> 14:26.560
<i>This is three stations away 
from where I last saw him.</i>

14:27.600 --> 14:30.660
<i>Did he sense me from that distance?</i>

14:30.660 --> 14:32.860
<i>He's formidable indeed!</i>

14:33.250 --> 14:37.420
<i>But I </i>will<i> enjoy my day off, so there!</i>

14:37.850 --> 14:39.600
<i>I'll just go elsewhere.</i>

14:40.140 --> 14:42.720
Hey, it's okay!

14:51.600 --> 14:54.230
<i>Curse you, Ranger!</i>

14:54.230 --> 14:58.130
<i>Next time I see you while I'm on 
the clock, you're gonna get it!</i>

14:58.500 --> 15:02.350
<i>I can't deal with any more interruptions.</i>

15:02.810 --> 15:03.760
Excuse me.

15:06.190 --> 15:09.590
<i>Guess I might as well deal with this now.</i>

15:11.000 --> 15:13.630
What a coincidence, Ranger.

15:13.630 --> 15:16.900
You gave me an umbrella once
 when it was raining.

15:16.900 --> 15:20.250
You've also given me directions
 countless times.

15:20.810 --> 15:21.760
Yeah...

15:21.760 --> 15:24.230
It's belated, but this is a thank-you.

15:24.230 --> 15:25.900
Well, thanks.

15:26.190 --> 15:29.890
You weren't following me around 
so you could catch me?

15:29.890 --> 15:32.120
I was lost and happened to see you.

15:32.120 --> 15:34.000
So I thought, "Now's my chance!"

15:34.300 --> 15:38.570
Now we're totally even, 
nice guy from the Evil League.

15:38.870 --> 15:41.240
See you next time, when I defeat you!

15:50.140 --> 15:53.020
You have good taste, Ranger.

15:56.240 --> 15:57.970
Red, come quick.

15:58.610 --> 15:59.580
Pink, what's the—

15:59.580 --> 16:01.620
Shh! Come here <i>quietly</i>.

16:01.620 --> 16:02.390
Okay...

16:02.390 --> 16:03.540
Check this out.

16:06.880 --> 16:10.370
Wow! All three of them are asleep
 in the same pose!

16:11.320 --> 16:13.940
Is this Ranger resonance?!

16:14.320 --> 16:17.120
Lie down in the same pose, Red.

16:17.120 --> 16:18.680
What? Me?

16:19.030 --> 16:20.170
Where?

16:20.170 --> 16:24.780
Either next to Mugi or Sora,
 whatever. But hurry.

16:31.250 --> 16:34.000
You wanted to take a picture, Pink?

16:34.690 --> 16:38.010
Yeah, I thought I'd send it to Black.

16:38.370 --> 16:41.810
He likes this sort of thing lots.

16:58.530 --> 17:02.290
Lookie, lookie

16:58.530 --> 17:02.290
Red's there because I made him

17:08.650 --> 17:11.760
<i>Your meeting starts in ten minutes.</i>

17:13.820 --> 17:18.080
<i>Black, disquieting movements 
detected amongst the enemy forces.</i>

17:20.880 --> 17:22.250
...awake.

17:23.060 --> 17:23.820
<i>Black.</i>

17:23.820 --> 17:25.370
I'm awake.

17:26.300 --> 17:27.310
<i>Black.</i>

17:28.280 --> 17:29.700
I'm awake.

17:32.360 --> 17:34.100
<i>No going back to sleep.</i>

17:34.850 --> 17:36.870
I'm already up.

17:54.290 --> 17:56.960
<i>Preparations are complete, General.</i>

18:27.910 --> 18:30.120
Nice guy from the Evil League!

18:30.510 --> 18:32.370
We meet again!

18:39.110 --> 18:43.770
It's our duty to defeat all of you!

18:57.150 --> 18:58.810
Let's have a fair—

19:06.670 --> 19:07.780
Red!

19:10.140 --> 19:12.250
Come get some!

19:15.790 --> 19:17.780
Eat this, Ranger!

19:30.320 --> 19:32.320
Very good. Keep it up.

19:32.320 --> 19:35.280
Let's get some more data 
out of those Rangers.

19:45.570 --> 19:46.530
Whoop.

21:20.800 --> 21:23.420
Panda Fair

22:11.030 --> 22:16.680
<i>I'm a high-ranking officer 
of the Evil League, which fights daily</i>

22:16.680 --> 22:22.520
<i>to claim the Earth in the 
name of our home planet.</i>

22:40.210 --> 22:44.050
<b>You'll find convenient ready-made food at the checkout counter!</b>

22:44.050 --> 22:46.250
Thank you so much!

22:48.090 --> 22:49.780
Come again!

22:58.810 --> 23:03.560
<i>But I would never do battle 
with the Rangers today.</i>

23:03.910 --> 23:06.570
<i>Yes, because after all...</i>

23:09.100 --> 23:12.090
<i>it's my day off.</i>

23:15.580 --> 23:20.070
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>
